[P_05_Displace01_AlarmCheck]
POPUPMESSAGE_0008=Alarm Stage One
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Fisher, be careful with the alarms, you're in a building full of mercenaries.
POPUPMESSAGE_0009=Alarm Stage Two - Enemies Equipping Body Armor
Note_0012L=Enemies are wearing body armor
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=LAMBERT - I'm serious Sam...too many alarms these mercenaries will be after you.
POPUPMESSAGE_0010=Alarm Stage Three - Enemies Equipping Helmets
Note_0013L=Enemies are wearing helmets
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=LAMBERT - Fisher... be careful! One more alarm and you'll be in big trouble.
POPUPMESSAGE_0011=Alarm Stage Four - Full Alert - Enemies Fortifying Positions
Note_0014L=Enemies have fortified their positions
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0006L=LAMBERT - Dammit, Sam. The whole place is alerted! You'll have a hell of a time fighting your way out of there without killing anyone. Complete your primary objectives and get out of there!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0007L=LAMBERT - Dammit, Sam. They called a general alarm... get out of there fast.
Objective_0017=Insert tracer programs into Displace's division servers
Objective_0018=Grimsdottir will be better able to monitor Displace's activities if you can insert tracer programs into the small servers in each of Displace's divisions
Objective_0015=Discover the real identity of Milan Nedich.
Objective_0016=Third Echelon's files draw a blank on the name Milan Nedich, Displace's VP of Protection Services. Find out what his real identity is.

[P_05_Displace01_BGuardConvo]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=-DisSol_Leif- Hey... NASA just reported the astronauts on the ISS managed to get their life support back on line.
Speech_0010L=-DisSol_Jeff- So they're gonna make it?
Speech_0011L=-DisSol_Leif- Well... probably not... but at least they have time to attempt a rescue...
Speech_0012L=-DisSol_Jeff- The shuttle?
Speech_0013L=-DisSol_Leif- Yeah... NASA is working to repair the rocket assembly... they think they might be able to launch in time.
Speech_0014L=-DisSol_Jeff- What about the Chinese rescue?
Speech_0015L=-DisSol_Leif- I guess we don't need them anymore.
Speech_0016L=-DisSol_Jeff- Hm. Well, here's hoping nothing else goes wrong.

