[P_05_Displace01_ConferenceEvents]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0061L=-DisExc_Julian- Well, you're worried about the cost Tom... you're worried about what the taxpayers will think. But it's a mistake to think that those two things are fundamentally tied together. Stairs are cheaper than elevators Tom... why don't we have stairs as the fourth discipline of skyscraper construction?
Speech_0041L=-NYCCiv_Tom- No one is going to take the stairs up seventy stories...
Speech_0042L=-DisExc_Julian- And does anyone ever question how much an elevator costs?
Speech_0043L=-NYCCiv_Tom- Of course not.
Speech_0044L=-DisExc_Julian- Right. And I'll tell you why. Because the cost of an elevator isn't measured by what you get... it's measured by what you avoid. Displace is expensive, Tom... no denying that. But it's not important how much it costs to hire us. What's important is how much it costs not to hire us. A bunch of good ol' boys from the Appalachian's with M4's on every street corner... sure it will get the job done. In the end, relying on the National Guard is like taking the stairs. If you want to keep those five million executives going to work everyday, I suggest you take the elevator.
Speech_0051L=-NYCCiv_Tom- Hmm... well... you maybe got a point there Julian.
Speech_0052L=-DisExc_Julian- Of course I have a point. Let's go talk to Mikey.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0031L=-DISP_NARRATOR- Displace International is a PMC - or Private Military Company. We specialize in situation resolution and consulting.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0032L=-DISP_NARRATOR- Our Mission is to offer governments and similar recognized and legal clients the capability to quickly and professionally resolve conflict-potential situations in a responsible manner.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0033L=-DISP_NARRATOR- In order to remain above reproach, Displace maintains very strict policies. We accept contracts only from recognized governments or institutions or from morally justified liberation movements recognized by said institutions.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0034L=-DISP_NARRATOR- Displace will not contract itself to terrorists, embargoed regimes, governments or organizations who contravene human rights, international organized crime, illegal arms traders,  or any group that does not recognize the fundamental laws of armed conflict.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0035L=-DISP_NARRATOR- Displace offers three key services, forming the cornerstones of our business: Strategic, Logistical, and Operational.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0036L=-DISP_NARRATOR- Strategically, Displace offers a number of services including strategic planning, research and analysis, defense reviews, military restructuring and review, and threat analysis.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0037L=-DISP_NARRATOR- On the Logistics front, Displace is able to support communications, transportation, and personnel services, public relations, escort services, and C and C services.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0038L=-DISP_NARRATOR- Operationally, Displace is able to provide basic military and police training, special forces and intelligence training, disaster relief training, demilitarization, security and peace-keeping training, as well as conduct, co-ordinate and command operations at all levels of conflict resolution.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0039L=-DISP_NARRATOR- Contracting Displace is a multi-stage process that typically begins with a detailed presentation of our capabilities, and moves through several steps of evaluation and proposals...for more information about Displace International, contact us online at www dot Displace dotcom.

