[P_05_Displace01_DHackSequence]
POPUPMESSAGE_0032=Retrieve the server access algorithm.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0007L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, give them a chance to stand still and you might have time to wirelessly hack into the laptop.
Speech_0008L=FISHER - I'm working on it Grim.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Damn... missed your chance. Keep tailing them, you might get another opportunity.
Speech_0010L=FISHER - Okay.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Damn, that's another opportunity gone.
Speech_0012L=FISHER - Grim, this is not as easy as it looks.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0015L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Well, I guess that's one way to deal with it.
Speech_0016L=FISHER - Finesse is for the young and the cocky.
POPUPMESSAGE_0033=Retrieve the server access algorithm.
POPUPMESSAGE_0034=Retrieve the server access algorithm.
Speech_0035L=-GRIMSDOTTIR- Dammit, Sam, that laptop had the server access algorithm on it... you'll need to see if he has the info backed up on another server.
Speech_0022L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Dammit, Sam, that laptop had the access algorithm for Displace's Central Server. You'll need to find another way to get it.
Speech_0023L=FISHER - Any ideas?
Speech_0026L=GRIMSDOTTIR - That executive might keep his laptop synched to another server somewhere.
Speech_0027L=FISHER - I'll have a look.
Note_0029L=The Central Server access algorithm is on a local server in the training room
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0030L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Dammit, Sam, that laptop had the server access algorithm on it... you'll need to see if he has the info backed up on another server.
Note_0031L=The Central Server access algorithm is on a local server in the training room

[P_05_Displace01_DHackSuccess]
POPUPMESSAGE_0012=Access the Central Server in the server room
Speech_0014L=-GRIMSDOTTIR- Good work Sam, now you'll be able to access the central server on the first floor.
Speech_0001L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good work Sam, now you'll be able to access the central server on the first floor.
Speech_0002L=FISHER - This wireless stuff makes life a lot easier.
Speech_0003L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Yep...welcome to the wi-fi era.
Speech_0004L=FISHER - Remember, you're saying that to a guy from the hi-fi era.
Speech_0005L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Hi-fi? As in, like, high in fiber?
Speech_0006L=FISHER - Rrrr. Don't put me in adult undergarments yet, kid. 
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good work Sam, now you'll be able to access the central server on the first floor.
POPUPMESSAGE_0013=Access the Central Server in the server room
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0007L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Okay, we have the access algorithm. Now we can access the central server on the first floor.
Speech_0008L=FISHER - I'll find it.
Note_0010L=The key code between the meeting room and the lobby is 8136

