[P_05_Displace01_InterroLobbyGuardA]
Note_0021L=There is a medical kit near the server room.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=-FISHER- Tell me something useful and be quick about it.
Speech_0004L=-DisSol_Jordan- Uh... I got a fix on a horse... Fancy Nancy in the third at Belmont tomorrow...
Speech_0005L=-FISHER- I think you can do better
Speech_0006L=-DisSol_Jordan- Uh...uh... medical supplies... they keep some in the bathroom near the security check point by the main server room.
Speech_0007L=-FISHER- Medical supplies hunh? Thanks.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0010L=-FISHER- How do I get these elevators working?
Speech_0011L=-DisSol_Jordan- Ah... uh... elevators? They've been a mess since the power went out... you'll need to hit the main breakers in the electrical room next to the main server
Speech_0012L=-FISHER- Main breakers...
Speech_0013L=-DisSol_Jordan- You need to head through the R&D section... the door code is 2109...
Speech_0014L=-FISHER- Thanks... you've been so kind.
Speech_0015L=-DisSol_Jordan- You...you're welcome.
Note_0022L=The key code for the server room is 2109
Speech_0016L=-DisSol_Jordan- Please... don't hurt me.
Speech_0018L=-DisSol_Jordan- God help me...

[P_05_Displace01_InterroLobbyGuardB]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=-FISHER- How many staff you have in the building?
Speech_0004L=-DisSol_Louis- Uh... I... I'm not sure...m... maybe thirty of us...
Speech_0005L=-FISHER- Maybe? How many are armed?
Speech_0006L=-DisSol_Louis- I'm not too sure... maybe twenty... maybe a few more.
Speech_0007L=-FISHER- That's a lot of maybes.
Speech_0008L=-DisSol_Louis- I'm not good with numbers...
Speech_0009L=-FISHER- Are you good at getting thumped on the skull and lying quietly in a dark corner for a few hours?
Speech_0012L=-DisSol_Louis- Please...I don't know anything more...
Speech_0014L=-DisSol_Louis- Ahh...this is gonna hurt isn't it?

[P_05_Displace01_InterroNYC]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=-FISHER- Is New York City thinking about hiring Displace to protect Manhattan?
Speech_0002L=-NYCCiv_Tom- Ah! Oh god...uh... yeah...
Speech_0003L=-FISHER- As far as PMC's go... Displace isn't so bad... but you have no idea what you're getting into...
Speech_0004L=-NYCCiv_Tom- What do you mean?
Speech_0005L=-FISHER- Remember the mafia?
Speech_0006L=-NYCCiv_Tom- Yeah... I've... I've heard stories...
Speech_0007L=-FISHER- Well imagine if instead of a bunch of thick-necked goons with stilettos the city was indebted to an army of sociopathic snake-eaters who were loyal to the highest bidder...
Speech_0008L=-NYCCiv_Tom- That doesn't sound good.
Speech_0009L=-FISHER- It wasn't the barbarians who sacked Rome... it was the expatriate Legionnaires who mustered barbarian armies...
Speech_0010L=-NYCCiv_Tom- You're scaring me.
Speech_0011L=-FISHER- Get out while you can.
Speech_0013L=-NYCCiv_Tom- I think I wet my pants...
Speech_0015L=-NYCCiv_Tom- Please... I'm just an elected official... I have no real power.

[P_05_Displace01_InterroOfficeExec]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=-FISHER- Gotcha. Now give me the server access algorithm...
Speech_0004L=-DisExc_Julian- ...uh... I... I can't...
Speech_0005L=-FISHER- What do you mean you can't?
Speech_0006L=-DisExc_Julian- The algorithm is several thousand characters long... it's encoded on my laptop... and on a server in the conference room on the far side of the lobby...
Speech_0007L=-FISHER- Oh... how do I get there...
Speech_0008L=-DisExc_Julian- The door code to the lobby is 8136.
Speech_0009L=-FISHER- Thanks...
Note_0049L=The key code between the meeting room and the lobby is 8136
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0010L=-FISHER- Where are you going?
Speech_0011L=-DisExc_Julian- Ah!...Uh... I was going to the operations room...
Speech_0012L=-FISHER- What's in the conference room?
Speech_0013L=-DisExc_Julian- Uh... not much... there's a server there... it's where I synch my laptop and get the main server access algorithm.
Speech_0014L=-FISHER- Interesting.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0015L=-FISHER- Nice little office you got here...
Speech_0016L=-DisExc_Julian- Oh god... who are you?
Speech_0017L=-FISHER- Someone you don't want to run into in the dark... give me the server access algorithm.
Speech_0020L=-DisExc_Julian- ...uh... I... I can't...
Speech_0021L=-FISHER- What do you mean you can't?
Speech_0022L=-DisExc_Julian- The algorithm is several thousand characters long... it's encoded here on my laptop... and on a server in the conference room across the hall...
Speech_0023L=-FISHER- Thanks.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0024L=-FISHER- Main server room... where is it?
Speech_0027L=-DisExc_Julian- Ah... uh... one level down... next to the R&D labs... but... but you'll need the server access algorithm...
Speech_0028L=-FISHER- Way ahead of ya, partner
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0030L=-FISHER- You look like an executive type... What do you do here?
Speech_0031L=-DisExc_Julian- Oh, god... I... I'm the North American Business Development Manager.
Speech_0034L=-FISHER- Really... how much do they pay you?
Speech_0035L=-DisExc_Julian- Who cares about the salary? It's the kick-backs. I'm part owner of three gold mines in Tunisia... on paper... I'm a billionaire...
Speech_0038L=-FISHER- Jesus... I'm in the wrong line of work.
Speech_0039L=-DisExc_Julian- I can get you a meeting with our VP of Internal Development...
Speech_0040L=-FISHER- I'd like that... where's his office?
Speech_0041L=-DisExc_Julian- Top floor, with the other Executive offices...
Speech_0042L=-FISHER- Nedich's office is up there too?
Speech_0043L=-DisExc_Julian- M...Milan? Yeah...
Speech_0044L=-FISHER- Thanks
Speech_0045L=-DisExc_Julian- God... please... don't hurt me...
Speech_0047L=-DisExc_Julian- Please don't kill me... I'm just an executive

