[P_05_Displace01_InterroRoof]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=-FISHER- Something going on with the ventilation system?
Speech_0002L=-DisSol_Walter- Ah! Wh...hey... who are you?
Speech_0003L=-FISHER- Pretend I'm Harry Tuttle...
Speech_0004L=-DisSol_Walter- Who?
Speech_0005L=-FISHER- I'm an ill-tempered and heavily armed heating engineer who's asking questions about your ventilation system...
Speech_0006L=-DisSol_Walter- Uh...I guess... I guess it's not working properly since the blackout. 
Speech_0007L=-FISHER- So it shouldn't take much to shut down that big fan if I wanted to?
Speech_0008L=-DisSol_Walter- Uh... I don't know... why would you want to do that...?
Speech_0009L=-FISHER- The adventure... the travel...
Speech_0010L=-DisSol_Walter- Uh... okay...
Note_0014L=The rooftop ventilation fan can be disabled from a breaker.
Speech_0011L=-DisSol_Walter- I don't care what you do with the fan... just don't kill me.
Speech_0013L=-DisSol_Walter- Don't forget to fill out your twenty-seven B stroke six.

[P_05_Displace01_InterroSecGuard]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=-FISHER- I know this is embarrassing... just tell me what I want to know and we can pretend this never happened.
Speech_0002L=-DisSol_Timothy- Jesus...Deal. What do you want?
Speech_0005L=-FISHER- How do I access the Main Server Room?
Speech_0006L=-DisSol_Timothy- I'm not sure... I think you might have to cut through R&D.
Speech_0007L=-FISHER- Thanks.
Speech_0008L=-DisSol_Timothy- I'd say 'my pleasure'... but...
Speech_0009L=-FISHER- Forget it... I don't want to know.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0012L=-FISHER- How do I access the Main Server Room?
Speech_0013L=-DisSol_Timothy- Ah... uh...can't get through here... our doors are malfunctioning...
Speech_0014L=-FISHER- Is there another way?
Speech_0015L=-DisSol_Timothy- Maybe through R&D... might be a way through the ventilation, into the electrical room.
Speech_0019L=-FISHER- Thanks.
Speech_0016L=-DisSol_Timothy- Oh god... don't do what I think you're going to do...
Speech_0018L=-DisSol_Timothy- I co-operated... please...

[P_05_Displace01_InterroServElevator]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=-FISHER- What are you doing here?
Speech_0008L=-DisSol_Alex- Oh... no... I'm... resetting the power to the central elevator
Speech_0009L=-FISHER- The elevator... once that's back on, I'll be able to go to the upper floors?
Speech_0010L=-DisSol_Alex- Yeah...
Speech_0011L=-FISHER- Tell you what. You just relax... I'll deal with the elevator.
Speech_0015L=-DisSol_Alex- Whatever you say.
Speech_0012L=-DisSol_Alex- Just don't kill me, please.
Speech_0013L=-DisSol_Alex- You need to reset the breaker to power the elevator.

[P_05_Displace01_InterroServerTech]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=-FISHER- I had a bit of a problem with your server...
Speech_0004L=-DisTech_Jack- ...ah... please don't kill me...
Speech_0005L=-FISHER- The files I want got shunted off to another computer...
Speech_0006L=-DisTech_Jack- There should be a back-up here...
