Speech_0008L=-DisTech_Jack- Milan? He's the VP of Protection Operations... his office is on the upper floors...
Speech_0009L=-FISHER- Don't you think it's suspicious that he's hiding files?
Speech_0010L=-DisTech_Jack- Uh... yeah... I guess...
Speech_0014L=-DisTech_Jack- I don't know anything else
Speech_0015L=-DisTech_Jack- Please... please let me live.

[P_05_Displace01_InterroVIPExec]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=-FISHER- Nice suit... Italian?
Speech_0002L=-DisExc_Karol- Oh...oh no...uh... Italian... yes... Florentine silk... Andretti...
Speech_0003L=-FISHER- Who's Andretti?
Speech_0004L=-DisExc_Karol- Andretti? The famous designer... men's suits... tuxedos...
Speech_0005L=-FISHER- I'm not a tuxedo kind of guy...
Speech_0006L=-DisExc_Karol- But... but aren't you some kind of spy...
Speech_0007L=-FISHER- Yeah... I'm the real kind... not the tuxedo kind. I'm the kind of spy who gets blood all over your Andretti unless you give me information...
Speech_0008L=-DisExc_Karol- Oh...god... please... don't ruin my suit...
Speech_0009L=-FISHER- How about a door code?
