Speech_0001L=-FISHER- Gotcha...
Speech_0002L=-DisSol_Paul- Hey...you're not supposed to be here!
Speech_0003L=-FISHER- Tell me something useful and I'll leave...
Speech_0004L=-DisSol_Paul- Forget it...I won't tell you anything.
