Note_0017L=The doorcode to the CEO meeting room is 2346
Speech_0013L=-DisSol_Paul- Please... I'm scared of heights...
Speech_0015L=-DisSol_Paul- I won't tell anyone you were here.

[P_05_Displace01_Lambert]
POPUPMESSAGE_0081=Retrieve the server access algorithm.
Speech_0089L=-GRIMSDOTTIR- Sam, you need the access codes form the Executive's laptop. See if you can tap into it wirelessly.
Speech_0017L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Fisher, that executive...he probably has the daily access algorithm for the Displace central servers stored on his laptop.
Speech_0018L=FISHER - Lambert gave me pretty strict non-lethal parameters.
Speech_0019L=GRIMSDOTTIR - If you stay close you should be able to hack into his laptop wirelessly.
Speech_0020L=FISHER - I'll give it a whirl.
Note_0069L=The Central Server access algorithm is on the executive's laptop
Note_0082L=Electrochromic windows can be made transparent or opaque with the OCP.
Speech_0090L=-REDDING- The windows are made with electrochromic glass. Specifications on your OPSAT.
Speech_0021L=REDDING - Whoa.
Speech_0022L=FISHER - That was weird.
Speech_0023L=REDDING - Yeah...I've heard of this. It's called an electrochromic window. A small electric charge can change the opacity of microscopic crystals embedded in the glass.
Speech_0024L=FISHER - Cool.
Speech_0025L=REDDING - I'm thinking that your OCP should be able to toggle the state of the windows. I'm uploading the specification to your OPSAT.
Speech_0026L=FISHER - Thanks Will.
Note_0083L=Electrochromic windows can be made transparent or opaque with the OCP.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0078L=REDDING - The windows are made with electrochromic glass. Specifications on your OPSAT.
Speech_0091L=-REDDING- Milan Nedich. VP Protection Operations...Displace International.
Speech_0027L=REDDING - Milan Nedich. VP Protection Operations...Displace International.
Speech_0028L=FISHER - He was in charge of the Morgenholt detail in Peru?
Speech_0029L=REDDING - Yeah...and now he's in charge of Zherkezhi... and... damn... he's as clean as a whistle. Looks like he's been zeroed.
Speech_0032L=FISHER - Hm...well whoever he is, he's playing both sides. We need to inform Shetland.
Speech_0033L=REDDING - Shetland is on his own. We can't compromise OPSEC for private interests.
Speech_0034L=FISHER - Fine...then I'm gonna try and take a look behind some of those zeros.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0080L=REDDING - Milan Nedich. VP Protection Operations...Displace International.
Note_0084L=There might be a way into the Central Server room though R&D ventilation
Speech_0087L=-GRIMSDOTTIR- It looks like some employees managed to get stuck between the double doors leaving to the server room. You'll have to find another way in there.
Speech_0035L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Hmm...small problem Sam. A couple staffers got locked between the double doors leading to the server room.
Speech_0038L=FISHER - That kind makes it hard to get through.
Speech_0039L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Yeah...there might be another way... looks like there are some heat exchange vents in this part of the building... you might be able to find a way out there if you head through the R&D section.
Speech_0040L=FISHER - I'll snoop around.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0074L=GRIMSDOTTIR - It looks like some employees managed to get stuck between the double doors leaving to the server room. You'll have to find another way in there.
Note_0085L=There might be a way into the Central Server room though R&D ventilation
Speech_0088L=-GRIMSDOTTIR- Check for a ventilation system. You might be able to find a way through.
Speech_0001L=GRIMSDOTTIR - There's got to be a way through to the server room from this area.
Speech_0002L=FISHER - Firing ranges usually have ventilation to clear the smoke... it probably ties into the AC system for the server room.
Speech_0003L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good thinking.
Note_0086L=There might be a way into the Central Server room though R&D ventilation
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0076L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Check for a ventilation system. You might be able to find a way through.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Uh...sorry to interrupt, but...
Speech_0005L=FISHER - I see it.
Speech_0006L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Power's coming back on.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - I see it Grim...
Speech_0008L=GRIMSDOTTIR - You got company incoming... you might want to--
Speech_0009L=FISHER - I see it!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0010L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Uh...sorry to interrupt, but...
Speech_0011L=FISHER - And he said let there be light...
Speech_0012L=GRIMSDOTTIR - That's gonna make for a lot of happy New Yorkers...
Speech_0013L=FISHER - Is there another kind?
Speech_0014L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Well, those two guys that were trapped between the doors don't seem very happy.
Speech_0015L=FISHER - Well, for them, the lights are still out.
Speech_0016L=GRIMSDOTTIR - True.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0041L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, you're going to need to manually restore power to Displace's elevators before you can get to the upper floors.
Speech_0042L=FISHER - Will do.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0043L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Uh Sam...you better hide...
Speech_0046L=FISHER - Where? I'm in a glass elevator.
Speech_0047L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Well, someone else is in the other glass elevator on their way down...
Speech_0048L=FISHER - Wonderful...
Note_0073L=The key code for the fire escape door 3485
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0050L=LAMBERT - Fisher, I'm afraid we might be facing an orchestrated attempt to push the world into a major crisis. Zherkezhi might know more about information warfare than anyone on earth, and the fact that Displace is combat-ready, essentially stateless, and better equipped than most governments...we need to find out fast whether this is a coincidence, or whether someone inside Displace is making a major move. That said, State Department has several very significant contracts with Displace. This thing is extremely political. I hate to do this to you, but keep it clean. Recon only. No fatalities.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0051L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Displace's Offices are on the top three floors of the Hantz Center Tower in downtown Manhattan. Recent financials indicate that they have invested heavily in their local infrastructure in order to maintain full operational capacity following even a major terrorist incident.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0052L=REDDING - Satellite confirms Grim's data. Displace is up and running at near-to-full capacity. It looks like they might be holding a meeting with members of New York City Council... possibly making a bid for protection or policing services to supplement the National Guard. They're prepared and opportunistic, that's for sure, but I wouldn't expect anything different. My money says they're playing fair, but if the boss wants to take a closer look, then that's what we'll do.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0055L=LAMBERT - Fisher, this is  a recon mission. Find out if Displace and Zherkezhi are working together and do not kill anyone
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0056L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, you're going to need to manually restore power to Displace's elevators before you can get to the upper floors.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0061L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, you need the access codes form the Executive's laptop. See if you can tap into it wirelessly.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0067L=O'DELL - Now almost 48 hours into the blackout, State governments in New York, New Jersey, Connecticut, Massachusetts, and Pennsylvania have authorized deployment of the National Guard to help keep the peace as tensions and hysteria rises.
Speech_0068L=O'DELL - Meanwhile, the USS Walsh sailed past Pearl Harbor, Hawaii this morning, en route to her duties in the Yellow Sea. The Walsh was escorted by her sister ship for fifty miles to symbolizes her vigil over the fifty states of the Union. The Walsh is expected to arrive in the Yellow Sea to join and assume C and C duties over Reagan Carrier Group in two days.

