[P_05_Displace01_Objectives]
Objective_0001=Don't kill anyone.
Objective_0095=Displace must not discover that intelligence operations are active against them. Killing anyone during the mission will result in immediate mission failure.
Objective_0038=Retrieve the server access algorithm.
Objective_0096=Recover Displace's Central Server access algorithm by hacking the laptop of the executive in the meeting room or checking for a back-up in the training area.
Objective_0039=Access the Central Server in the server room
Objective_0097=Access the Central Server to determine if Displace is complicit in Zherkezhi's possible crimes. Find a way in through the R&D section.
POPUPMESSAGE_0113=Don't kill anyone.
Speech_0121L=-LAMBERT- Fisher, this is  a recon mission. Find out if Displace and Zherkezhi are working together and do not kill anyone.
Speech_0013L=LAMBERT - Fisher, we need to find out if Displace and Zherkezhi are working together.
Speech_0043L=FISHER - But until we know, you want me to keep it quiet.
Speech_0044L=LAMBERT - Don't kill anyone, or I'll abort the mission. The Pentagon has contracts with Displace all around the world...the President will have puppies if he finds out we're doing this.
Objective_0082=Insert tracer programs into Displace's division servers
Objective_0098=Grimsdottir will be better able to monitor Displace's activities if you can insert tracer programs into the small servers in each of Displace's divisions
Speech_0122L=-GRIMSDOTTIR- Sam, it would be a big help if you could tap the servers in each of Displace's divisions with a little program I whipped up and put on your OPSAT.
Speech_0016L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, each of Displace's different divisions seems to have its own server farm. I've put a program on your OPSAT that will build a little back door into their networks.
Speech_0048L=FISHER - You want me to upload that to each division server?
Speech_0049L=GRIMSDOTTIR - I would appreciate it.
Speech_0050L=FISHER - Since you asked so nice...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0110L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, it would be a big help if you could tap the servers in each of Displace's divisions with a little program I whipped up and put on your OPSAT.
Objective_0011=Discover who is in charge of the Zherkezhi protection detail.
Objective_0099=Search Displace's servers to find any information about the Zherkezhi protection detail and who is in charge.
Objective_0008=Exfiltrate from the primary extraction point.
Objective_0100=Exfiltrate to the roof using the fire stairs on the south side of the top floor.
POPUPMESSAGE_0114=Exfiltrate from the primary extraction point.
Objective_0094=Find information linking Displace and Zherkhezi
Objective_0101=User 'mnedich' has removed files relating to the Zherkezhi protection detail from the Central Server. Check his personal computer in his office on the top floor.
Objective_0125=Discover the real identity of Milan Nedich.
Objective_0126=Third Echelon's files draw a blank on the name Milan Nedich, Displace's VP of Protection Services. Find out what his real identity is.
Note_0127L=The Laser Mic is part of the EEV.
POPUPMESSAGE_0115=Find information linking Displace and Zherkhezi
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0054L=LAMBERT - Damn. It looks like someone has shunted the data we need off the server... Login name, M Nedich.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0020L=FISHER-  Milan Nedich?
Speech_0057L=LAMBERT - That name is coming up an awful lot, but we still don't have anything on him.
Speech_0119L=-LAMBERT- Hmm... the data appears to have been moved to the terminal of Mnedich...Displace VP of Protection Operations... we'll need access to his computer in the Upper Offices.
Speech_0058L=FISHER - M Nedich? Who's that?
Speech_0059L=LAMBERT - Hmm... fragments here... looks like he's VP of Protection Operations for Displace.
Speech_0060L=FISHER - He protected Zherkezhi and Morgenholt? Hmm. Either he's not very good at his job, or he's dirty.
Speech_0061L=LAMBERT - Echelon has nothing on him. Looks like he's been zeroed.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0062L=-FISHER- Probably a pseudonym. I'll see if I can find out who he really is.
Speech_0063L=LAMBERT - In any case, we need to get access to his computer. His office should be on the upper floors somewhere.
Objective_0107=Find information linking Displace and Zherkhezi
Objective_0108=User 'mnedich' has removed files relating to the Zherkezhi protection detail from the Central Server. Check his personal computer in his office on the top floor.
POPUPMESSAGE_0116=Find information linking Displace and Zherkhezi
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0109L=LAMBERT - Hmm... the data appears to have been moved to the terminal of Mnedich...Displace VP of Protection Operations... we'll need access to his computer in the Upper Offices.
Objective_0128=Exfiltrate from the primary extraction point.
Objective_0129=Exfiltrate to the roof using the fire stairs on the south side of the top floor.
POPUPMESSAGE_0130=Exfiltrate from the primary extraction point.
Speech_0120L=(null)
Speech_0064L=LAMBERT - Hokkaido.
Speech_0067L=FISHER - Isn't Hokkaido like the Alaska of Japan?
Speech_0068L=LAMBERT - Yeah... looks like Milan Nedich has secretly relocated Zherkezhi there.
Speech_0069L=FISHER - Interesting... now we definitely need to talk to Shetland.
Speech_0070L=LAMBERT - We'll let State Department handle that mess. You're going to Hokkaido. We're sending a helicopter to evac you from the roof.
Objective_0131=Exfiltrate from the primary extraction point.
Objective_0132=Exfiltrate to the roof using the fire stairs on the south side of the top floor.
POPUPMESSAGE_0133=Exfiltrate from the primary extraction point.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0106L=LAMBERT - Looks like Milan Nedich has secretly relocated Zherkezhi to Hokkaido, Japan. We're sending a helicopter to evac you from the roof.
Speech_0123L=-REDDING- Milan Nowak... that's Nedich's real name. Turns out he's the Barber of Bosnia. Suspected war criminal from the Bosnian conflict.
Speech_0073L=REDDING - Good grab Fisher. Milan Nedich's real name... Jesus... Milos Nowak...
Speech_0074L=FISHER - Milos Nowak? Who is he?
Speech_0077L=REDDING - Barber of Bosnia. Suspected war criminal from the Bosnian conflict. Allegedly scalped some of his prisoners.
Speech_0078L=FISHER - Wanted in The Hague?
Speech_0079L=REDDING - Yeah.
Speech_0080L=FISHER - Bet you dollars to dinars that he doesn't make it to trial.
Speech_0081L=REDDING - That's okay... I think my money's safer on the Nikkei.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0112L=REDDING - Milan Nowak... that's Nedich's real name. Turns out he's the Barber of Bosnia. Suspected war criminal from the Bosnian conflict.
Objective_0092=Recover technical specifications for the Infrasound Generator
Objective_0103=Displaces R&D Division is prototyping a new LTL munition that uses infrasound. Try to find the technical specifications.
Objective_0093=Recover technical reports into ongoing Displace turret research
Objective_0104=Displace's R&D Division is conducting research into automated turrets. Try to find the technical specifications.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0083L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good work Sam, that's the first of their servers. If you can upload that to each of the other ones, I'll be able to snoop around as much as I please.
Speech_0084L=FISHER - I'll see what I can do.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0085L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good work Sam. Upload that program to the last server and you'll make me the happiest girl in the world.
Speech_0086L=FISHER - You're easy to please.
Speech_0087L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Access is a girl's best friend.
Speech_0124L=-GRIMSDOTTIR- Way to go Sam. Now I can peruse Displace's divisional files at my leisure.
Speech_0088L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Thanks Sam... that's the last one. I can't wait to sniff around in Displace's laundry basket
Speech_0089L=FISHER - Awww...
Speech_0090L=GRIMSDOTTIR - What?
Speech_0091L=FISHER - Laundry... I totally forgot...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0111L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Way to go Sam. Now I can peruse Displace's divisional files at my leisure.

[P_05_Displace01_OfficeEvents]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=-DisExc_Julian- ...certainly entitled to request protection at that level from the National Guard I agree, but face it, the National Guard is a massive, cumbersome organization.
Speech_0002L=-NYCCiv_Tom- Sure... that's what we need... a presence...
Speech_0020L=-DisExc_Julian- On the contrary. The people want protection... they need protection... but they don't want to see protection. It frightens them. Having the National Guard on every corner will keep the peace... but at what cost?
Speech_0021L=-NYCCiv_Tom- They'll get over it Julian. In the end, the thing they'll remember is that the National Guard is cheap. I'm dealing with tax payers here... the last thing I need is another fiscal accountability scandal.
Speech_0022L=-DisExc_Julian- Hm...
Speech_0023L=-NYCCiv_Tom- What?
Speech_0024L=-DisExc_Julian- C'mon... I wanna show you something...

