Speech_0002L=-DisTech_Micheal- Hi Jules. Hi Tom. Look, I think we're about ready to go with the presentation...
Speech_0003L=-DisExc_Julian- I think you can forget the presentation Mike. Tom's sold. Aren't you Tom?
Speech_0004L=-NYCCiv_Tom- Uh...well... yeah, I guess I am.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=-DisExc_Julian- Allright. You wait here, I'm gonna head into the other room and do up some paperwork.
Speech_0006L=-NYCCiv_Tom- Allright.

