Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0019L=-DisSol_A- It's a pretty cushy posting, that's for sure.
Speech_0020L=-DisSol_B- But I heard the guy was really annoying.
Speech_0021L=-DisSol_A- The guy isn't there anymore. He's outta town.
Speech_0022L=-DisSol_B- What? So you're just watching his stuff?
Speech_0023L=-DisSol_A- Yeah...emptying his liquor cabinet and playing video games... he's got the new Prince of Persia.
Speech_0024L=-DisSol_B- Yeah? I heard it's awesome.
Speech_0025L=-DisSol_A- Gonna be Game of the Year, man.
Speech_0026L=-DisSol_B- Can't wait to play it.

[P_05_Displace01_RDTechConvo]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=-DisTech_Vaclav- Got any plans for the long weekend?
Speech_0002L=-DisTech_Derek- Jesus... Fourth of July coming up. I forgot.
Speech_0003L=-DisTech_Vaclav- You forgot? How could you forget?
Speech_0004L=-DisTech_Derek- Ah... you know... been puttin' in crazy hours... don't even know what day it is.
Speech_0005L=-DisTech_Vaclav- Mm... yeah, I know what you mean... me and Anne-Marie are gonna head up to Maine, stay in a little Bed and Breakfast... eat some lobster...
Speech_0006L=-DisTech_Derek- Do they have power back in Maine yet?
Speech_0007L=-DisTech_Vaclav- Power? Whoa... forgot about that.
Speech_0008L=-DisTech_Derek- Ha. How could you forget?

