Speech_0002L=-DisSol_Walter- Hey, Marco asked me to ask you when you'd be finished getting the ventilation system running?
Speech_0008L=-DisTech_Rolf- I don't know. In a while.
Speech_0009L=-DisSol_Walter- Well, Marco says hurry up. Says the air is getting stale inside.
Speech_0010L=-DisTech_Rolf- What the hell do I care what Marco says? I don't even know him.
Speech_0011L=-DisSol_Walter- I'll tell him you said that.
Speech_0012L=-DisTech_Rolf- Ha. Go ahead.
Speech_0013L=-DisSol_Walter- Boy, are you in trouble.
Speech_0014L=-DisTech_Rolf- Whatever.

