[P_05_Displace01_SecurityEvents]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=-DisTech_Jack- Alright...alright...hold on...I think I got it.
Speech_0010L=-DisSol_Alex- Hurry up, I'm getting angry.
Speech_0011L=-DisTech_Jack- Look, let me just connect this wire here...aaaaannnd...
Speech_0012L=-DisSol_Alex- And?
Speech_0013L=-DisTech_Jack- ...aaaannnnd... Dammit.
Speech_0016L=-DisSol_Alex- Yer kiddin' me. I'm pulling the alarm...
Speech_0017L=-DisTech_Jack- Hold on, hold on...
Speech_0018L=-DisSol_Alex- I've been holding on for over an hour...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0019L=-DisTech_Jack- Ok...ok...this time I got it for sure. Hot, neutral, ground... got it all sorted out.
Speech_0022L=-DisSol_Alex- I'm gonna sort you out if you don't open the damn door.
Speech_0023L=-DisTech_Jack- No...I mean it...here...just connect this... yeah...now this... mm-hm... and...bingo!
Speech_0024L=-DisSol_Alex- Bingo?
Speech_0025L=-DisTech_Jack- uh...okay...that's not my fault...that's definitely caused by the blackout.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0026L=-DisSol_Alex- Well it's about time.
Speech_0027L=-DisTech_Jack- I told you, it wasn't my fault. It was the blackout.
Speech_0032L=-DisSol_Alex- Whatever...let's just hurry it up, will you.
Speech_0033L=-DisTech_Jack- Allright. I want to check the server and make sure nothing got fried when the power came back on.
Speech_0034L=-DisSol_Alex- Ok. Give a shout if you need anything.
Speech_0035L=-DisTech_Jack- Will do.

