[P_05_Displace01_VIPCEO]

[P_05_Displace01_VIPEvents]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=-DisSol_Matthew- I've been hearing some creepy stuff about Milan. I'm not sure I trust that guy.
Speech_0051L=-DisSol_Paul- Yeah. I heard he got drunk with some of the guys in Istanbul last month... wandered out of the bar looking for a fight...they found him the next morning covered in blood.
Speech_0060L=-DisSol_Matthew- What?
Speech_0061L=-DisSol_Paul- Yeah...Stan thinks he killed someone...read a newspaper article the next day...Istanbul police found some guy cut to ribbons just a couple blocks from the bar they were at.
Speech_0054L=-DisSol_Matthew- Whoa.
Speech_0055L=-DisSol_Paul- I think we should try and get on his PC in the executive offices, see if we can find anything.
Speech_0057L=-DisSol_Matthew- The code to the area is 2346, but I don't know the code for his actual office.
Speech_0058L=-DisSol_Paul- Alright...well, if I find out what it is, we'll go together.
Speech_0059L=-DisSol_Matthew- Alright.
Note_0066L=The key code for the CEOs meeting room is 2346

[P_05_Displace01_VIPLaserMic]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=-DisExc_Karol- Sorry to bring you in here so late, we need to put some extra men on the Zherkezhi detail. Your name came up.
Speech_0002L=-DisSol_Gerald- Zherkezhi? That's the whacko in the penthouse uptown?
Speech_0003L=-DisExc_Karol- Well, it's perhaps best not to refer to our client as 'the whacko'... but yes. Him. Or rather, his penthouse. Milos Nowak is--uh...
Speech_0004L=-DisSol_Gerald- Who?
Speech_0005L=-DisExc_Karol- Milan. Milan Nedich. Crazy slavic names...I always get them confused. Anyway, Zherkezhi is out of town, so there won't be a VIP. Just the property.
Speech_0006L=-DisSol_Gerald- Okay. Sounds like a breeze.
Speech_0007L=-DisExc_Karol- Well, it hasn't gone perfectly smooth so far...you'll get the full VIP rate and you'll be on duty as though there is a package on site.
Speech_0008L=-DisSol_Gerald- Ok. Got it.
Speech_0009L=-DisExc_Karol- Good. You report at thirteen hundred tomorrow.
Speech_0010L=-DisSol_Gerald- Ok. I'll be there.

[P_05_Displace01_VIPLoungeChair]

